waylay. For inflexions see VERBS IN -IE &¢., 1.
===
**waylay.** For inflexions see ^^VERBS IN -IE &c.^^, 1.
>>>

<<<
-ways. See -WISE.
===
**-ways.** See ^^-WISE^^.
